 "gallery_note": {
  "同属对照：印度池鹭 Ardeola grayii。本种（池鹭 A. bacchus）暂无开放授权的历史图版，故以同属近缘种绘图对照属级形态。": "Congener comparison: Indian Pond Heron Ardeola grayii. No openly licensed historical plate exists for Chinese Pond Heron (A. bacchus), so a close relative is used to show the genus.",
  "同属对照：斑椋鸟 Gracupica contra。本种（黑领椋鸟 G. nigricollis）暂无开放授权的历史图版，故以同属近缘种绘图对照属级形态。": "Congener comparison: Asian Pied Starling Gracupica contra. No openly licensed historical plate exists for Black-collared Starling (G. nigricollis), so a close relative is used to show the genus.",
  "同属对照：白琵鹭 Platalea leucorodia。本种（黑脸琵鹭 P. minor）暂无开放授权的历史图版，故以同属近缘种绘图对照属级形态。": "Congener comparison: Eurasian Spoonbill Platalea leucorodia. No openly licensed historical plate exists for Black-faced Spoonbill (P. minor), so a close relative is used to show the genus.",
  "哈德威克（Hardwicke）图版同时绘有大白鹭（左，Ardea alba modesta）与中白鹭（右，Mesophoyx intermedia）；本种取右侧个体对照。": "The Hardwicke plate shows both Great Egret (left, Ardea alba modesta) and Intermediate Egret (right, Mesophoyx intermedia); the right-hand bird is the reference here."
 },
